8.780" end="01:49.050">you </span><span begin="01:49.050" end="01:50.640">stay</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.850" end="01:53.460"><span begin="01:50.850" end="01:51.180">So </span><span begin="01:51.180" end="01:51.450">I </span><span begin="01:51.450" end="01:51.780">don't </span><span begin="01:51.780" end="01:52.260">have </span><span begin="01:52.260" end="01:52.530">to </span><span begin="01:52.530" end="01:53.460">say</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.460" end="01:57.870"><span begin="01:53.460" end="01:53.640">You </span><span begin="01:53.640" end="01:54.240">were </span><span begin="01:54.240" end="01:54.510">the </span><span begin="01:54.510" end="01:55.230">one </span><span begin="01:55.230" end="01:55.470">that </span><span begin="01:55.470" end="01:56.190">got </span><span begin="01:56.190" end="01:57.870">away</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.420" end="02:15.420"><span begin="02:12.420" end="02:12.660">The </span><span begin="02:12.660" end="02:13.170">one </span><span begin="02:13.170" end="02:13.500">that </span><span begin="02:13.500" end="02:13.920">got </span><span begin="02:13.920" end="02:15.420">away</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.840" end="02:23.040"><span begin="02:15.840" end="02:16.110">All </span><span begin="02:16.110" end="02:16.290">this </span><span begin="02:16.290" end="02:16.710">money </span><span begin="02:16.710" end="02:17.160">can't </span><span begin="02:17.160" end="02:17.400">buy </span><span begin="02:17.400" end="02:17.730">me </span><span begin="02:17.730" end="02:17.940">a </span><span begin="02:17.940" end="02:18.690">time </span><span begin="02:18.690" end="02:20.910">machine </span><span begin="02:20.910" end="02:20.940">（</span><span begin="02:20.940" end="02:22.170">No</span><span begin="02:22.170" end="02:23.040">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.040" end="02:30.390"><span begin="02:23.040" end="02:23.730">Can't </span><span begin="02:23.730" end="02:24.330">replace </sp